      "content": "hey i need some help with something weird. i was looking through some old school yearbooks today and there's just... stuff missing. like, i have a very clear memory of being part of a specific summer program at a science camp when i was 10, but there's no record of me being there in any of the local news archives or school files from that year. it feels like someone went in and just wiped the digital footprint. i have these flashes of a logo i don't recognize, but nothing online matches. can you help me look into this? i feel like i'm being gaslit by my own history.",
